WEBVTT

00:01:50.590 --> 00:01:52.750
All right! That's it for today's class!

00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:55.760
Be sure to put away your equipment as you leave.

00:01:56.510 --> 00:01:57.680
Ichiko!

00:01:58.340 --> 00:01:59.930
Let's walk back together!

00:01:59.930 --> 00:02:01.640
Hey! Kobayashi!

00:02:01.640 --> 00:02:04.640
Don't use the spirit lamp to make ramen!

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:06.100
That's not what it's meant for!

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:09.480
Uh, you wanna get some ramen on the way?

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:13.400
Sorry, but I have to get back early today.

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:15.900
What? Again?

00:02:15.900 --> 00:02:18.280
You've been like that all week! That hurts, man.

00:02:18.820 --> 00:02:22.280
Oh... Would you like to come over, then?

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:33.000
What's this?!

00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:36.130
It's too cute for this Earth!

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:37.550
Isn't she adorable?

00:02:37.550 --> 00:02:40.010
I can't stand it! She's too cute!

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:41.590
Look at her eyes!

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:44.350
What a generic name!

00:02:44.350 --> 00:02:46.560
I found her a week ago.

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:51.770
Someone had just abandoned her in the middle of the rain.

00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:56.530
Poor thing. She was shivering from the cold.

00:02:57.530 --> 00:02:59.990
She only just recovered.

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:03.870
Aw, who's a cute li'l kitty? Yes you are! Yes you are!

00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:06.040
You listening? You're gonna ruin that whole tough-girl image.

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:10.580
I had no idea you had a soft spot for animals.

00:03:10.580 --> 00:03:12.000
Being rich is great, eh?

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:14.790
You can afford to keep a dog <i>and</i> a cat!

00:03:14.790 --> 00:03:16.130
Hey, Momou!

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:21.880
Goddamnit! <i>I'm</i> the mascot of this show!

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:23.720
I won't let you upstage me!

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:25.220
Hey, wait!

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:26.640
Quit your whining!

00:03:27.270 --> 00:03:31.390
But, Miss Ichiko! You weren't this nice to me during my arc!

00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:33.560
That's not the same thing at all!

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:37.070
You were just pretending to be cute!
And it was creepy as hell, you mongrel!

00:03:37.070 --> 00:03:38.530
Hey, you're being a bit harsh...

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:42.700
It's as Miss Ichiko says.

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:45.870
A mongrel like me deserves to be abused.

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:47.240
He transformed!

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:50.750
What's with this damn racket?!

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:52.670
Can't I eat in peace?

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:58.210
So your name's Ranmaru, is it?

00:03:58.210 --> 00:03:58.630
Huh?

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:02.760
Trying to show up our debut, eh?

00:04:03.630 --> 00:04:06.930
If you want to be a female main character in this show,

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:09.310
are you aware that you need my permission?!

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:10.520
Really?!

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:11.890
Of course not!

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:14.520
Hm? What's this?

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:16.810
I see!

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:20.030
This won't do.

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:21.030
Change!

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:24.700
You got some fucking nerve, monk!

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:26.870
Come on, lemme have my fun!

00:04:27.780 --> 00:04:29.450
I haven't gotten any screen time in so long!

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:31.950
Kill! Kill!

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:34.210
Get out! All of you!

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:36.710
<i>Come to think of it...</i>

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:39.050
<i>The most annoying one of all isn't here.</i>

00:04:39.050 --> 00:04:41.210
<i>Though the prologue made it look like she was going to be involved somehow...</i>

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:46.390
Okay, see ya tomorrow!

00:04:46.390 --> 00:04:48.470
Uh... Wait a sec, Ranmaru!

00:04:48.470 --> 00:04:50.220
Hm? What is it?

00:04:50.220 --> 00:04:51.430
Uh...

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:56.980
You might not be aware of this, but if you continue to unwittingly drain others of their Fortune,

00:04:56.980 --> 00:05:00.820
you'll bring ruin to everyone you hold dear.

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:03.950
Sorry! It's nothing!

00:05:03.950 --> 00:05:07.200
You're a strange one. See ya!

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:17.580
<i>What am I so nervous about? The sooner I tell her, the better.</i>

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:22.800
Sorry, Fluffy! Bathroom break!

00:05:33.350 --> 00:05:34.430
Who the hell left <i>this</i>?

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:36.140
Sakura Ichiko, correct?

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:37.060
It can talk?!

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:39.560
Sorry for surprising you.

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:41.570
The shit stood up!

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:43.650
That's quite a rude way to put it.

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:49.070
I am Ibuki, a Toilet God. It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:05:49.070 --> 00:05:51.870
What's with those noseplugs?

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:56.120
Am I smelly? Am I that smelly?

00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:59.130
Or is it merely due to my color and appearance?

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:00.880
I thought it would be like this.

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:03.130
I guess it makes sense, given what I am.

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:07.880
Sorry, you're right. I shouldn't judge a book by its cover.

00:06:07.880 --> 00:06:11.640
You may say that, but you're still wearing those noseplugs!

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:14.770
It's fine! I'll just kill myself. That's right. That's the best way.

00:06:14.770 --> 00:06:16.180
Wait a sec, what did you say?

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:18.850
A god? So are you one of that God of Misfortune's friends?

00:06:18.850 --> 00:06:23.400
God of Misfortune? I'm unfamiliar with the person of whom you are speaking.

00:06:23.400 --> 00:06:24.110
Really?

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:26.690
But I have something more important to tell you.

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:31.870
In this world, there exist energies we refer to as Fortune and Misfortune.

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:35.450
Furthermore, you possess considerably more Fortune than normal hu—

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:37.290
Stop! Stop!

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:41.710
I think I understand what you came here to do.

00:06:41.710 --> 00:06:45.960
Really? I'm pleased to hear it. That makes things easie—

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:47.670
Excuse me, but what are you doing?

00:06:50.010 --> 00:06:51.760
Wh-Whoa!

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:53.510
Wh-What is this?!

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:57.020
Sorry, but I already have one God in my life.

00:06:57.520 --> 00:06:59.520
What the— Are you okay with this?

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:03.860
Your outrageous nature causes you to literally suck away other people's happiness!

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:07.820
Unless you do something about it,
the people around you will be ruined!

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:12.160
Ah... that's enough. I guess I deserve to be flushed away.

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:14.580
That's right. I guess I'll just...

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:16.160
die.

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:28.670
He said the exact same things as that God of Misfortune.

00:07:29.090 --> 00:07:32.550
<i>Are you okay with this? There's only a limited amount of Fortune in the world.</i>

00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:34.760
<i>While you grow richer, others grow poorer.</i>

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:38.930
<i>You might not be aware of this, but if you continue to unwittingly drain others of their Fortune,</i>

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:42.270
<i>you'll bring ruin to everyone you hold dear.</i>

00:07:42.270 --> 00:07:45.270
What a pain. She's like a broken record.

00:07:45.820 --> 00:07:48.070
I get it already.

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:53.200
I'm back! Fluffy?

00:07:54.320 --> 00:07:55.530
Fluffy?

00:07:58.830 --> 00:08:02.290
<i>What is it this time? I bet I know who this is from.</i>

00:08:04.130 --> 00:08:05.130
"To Cow-Tits:

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:06.460
I took your cat.

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:10.460
If ya want her back, get yo' ass over to the school's second gym! I'm fo' real!

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:12.590
Beauty Princess Momiji."

00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:14.640
That bitch!

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:22.480
Come on, Risa... How much ramen do you eat?

00:08:24.310 --> 00:08:26.560
S-Someone's here!

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:27.730
Seriously?

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:33.030
Hurry up, Risa! I'll just buy you some rice balls!

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:42.620
Oh ho, what's wrong? You sure look fierce.

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:45.000
Did you lose something precious? Maybe this?

00:08:46.460 --> 00:08:48.250
Let Fluffy go!

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:50.590
And who you calling "Cow-Tits", bitch?!

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:52.420
Good, good.

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:54.760
Seems like you still have a heart.

00:08:55.380 --> 00:09:00.010
I was happy that you took in this cat on that dark and stormy night.

00:09:00.560 --> 00:09:03.520
The cat that I put there, in front of your apartment building.

00:09:05.810 --> 00:09:07.770
Huh? You did?

00:09:07.770 --> 00:09:08.730
That's right.

00:09:10.110 --> 00:09:14.070
I'm no good at fighting long-term battles. I'm too impatient.

00:09:14.610 --> 00:09:16.450
But it looks like it paid off this time.

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:19.990
All I had to do was kidnap this cat,
and here you are looking all serious.

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:24.410
Even an idiot can recognize something that she's already tasted before.

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:28.330
The bitter flavor of losing someone dear to you.

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:34.920
If you weren't interested in the cat, I had planned on taking Ranmaru hostage instead.

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:39.300
But I doubt that would have been possible without breaking a few bones.

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:40.930
Why, you...

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:47.900
That does it. Looks like I'm gonna have to settle the score with you, no matter what!

00:09:48.650 --> 00:09:51.400
I'll beat you down and take back Fluffy!

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:52.570
Go!

00:09:52.570 --> 00:09:53.730
Oh dear.

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:57.320
You lose this round.

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:04.790
The end.

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:10.540
This here's a Dayson. No matter how much energy it drains, its suction power never weakens.

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:12.840
This thing was damn expensive, too.

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:14.460
Wh-What's that?

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:23.560
It's about time. With this, I'm one step closer to finishing my mission.

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:28.890
I'll see you again soon. Better watch your neck.

00:10:29.650 --> 00:10:33.650
When we next meet, your
Fortune-draining days will be over.

00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:36.650
You goddamn thief!

00:10:40.610 --> 00:10:41.950
Fluffy!

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:44.700
Hold on. I'm on my way.

00:10:48.790 --> 00:10:52.290
What the hell did she mean, "watch your neck"?

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:53.790
She's the one who should watch out!

00:10:53.790 --> 00:10:55.750
I'll get my Fortune back, no matter what!

00:10:56.130 --> 00:10:57.880
This won't all go her way.

00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:02.340
What the hell's going on?!

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:03.970
Fluffy!

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:08.310
Hang... Hang in there!

00:11:08.310 --> 00:11:10.230
We have to get out of here, fast!

00:11:18.110 --> 00:11:20.740
Bonus Round Number One!

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:31.000
All in just one second!

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:34.750
Bonus Round Number Two!

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:38.710
Quit just coming in whenever you like!

00:11:38.710 --> 00:11:40.720
Today's the day I...

00:11:40.720 --> 00:11:43.140
Uh... wait, wait.

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:45.220
Please, just let it slide. Just for today.

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:46.970
I'm on...

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:48.560
the second day of my period.

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:50.640
<i>I thought you said they were light?</i>

00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:52.020
<i>Is this some kind of dirty joke?</i>

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:54.190
Losing... blood...

00:12:03.490 --> 00:12:05.740
Look! The gym!

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:12.000
Wait, no! This is going too far!

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:14.790
I'm not supposed to <i>kill</i> her!

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:24.130
What can I do now? The exits are all closed off.

00:12:27.390 --> 00:12:32.520
<i>Happiness is something to be shared, you know.</i>

00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:35.520
I'm sorry, Fluffy.

00:12:36.440 --> 00:12:42.030
I was able to save Suwano, Tsuwabuki, and Ranmaru by giving them some of my Fortune,

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:44.070
but this time there's nothing I can do.

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:46.280
Without the right tools, I can't do anything.

00:12:46.780 --> 00:12:48.910
I can't do anything for you.

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:50.540
It's my fault.

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:54.420
I'm sorry, Fluffy! I'm so sorry!

00:12:54.420 --> 00:12:56.040
It looks like you finally understand.

00:12:56.960 --> 00:12:59.550
Or rather, you were made to understand.

00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:01.880
You're the Shit God.

00:13:01.880 --> 00:13:03.050
Toilet God, rather.

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:05.840
Hang on. You're kind of on fire.

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:06.970
Yes.

00:13:06.970 --> 00:13:11.270
As you can see, the shit's really hit the flames.

00:13:11.930 --> 00:13:13.980
You could at least laugh a little.

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:15.940
Even out of pity.

00:13:15.940 --> 00:13:19.310
I guess I was a fool to try and lighten the mood a little bit.

00:13:19.310 --> 00:13:21.940
Sorry. I really don't feel like it right now.

00:13:23.780 --> 00:13:25.820
Wait, did you come to save me?

00:13:26.070 --> 00:13:30.740
No. I'm under no obligation to help a selfish human like you.

00:13:30.740 --> 00:13:34.290
I came to save that kitten.

00:13:34.290 --> 00:13:35.500
Fluffy?

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:40.500
That's right. You didn't even hear me out.

00:13:41.050 --> 00:13:44.510
A Toilet God's duty is to look
after childbirth and childcare.

00:13:44.510 --> 00:13:48.720
I am charged with helping infant lifeforms grow into adulthood.

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:54.270
In other words, I came to save that kitten from <i>you</i>.

00:13:55.680 --> 00:13:58.850
Due to its young age, it already had very little Fortune to begin with,

00:13:58.850 --> 00:14:02.190
and now it has very little remaining, largely thanks to you.

00:14:02.650 --> 00:14:05.690
Surely you knew it would come to this.

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:11.830
All of the humans that have become close to you thus far have fallen to Misfortune.

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:14.950
But I saved them! I saved them all!

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:17.210
So you got to play both the villain <i>and</i> the heroine.

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:20.920
I'm sure you enjoyed your little charade,

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:23.210
but enough is enough, wouldn't you say?

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:28.430
Humans put everything they have into protecting their own little piece of happiness.

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:31.930
I don't think you have any right to take that away from them.

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:33.640
I...

00:14:33.640 --> 00:14:34.680
Oh dear.

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:37.940
If I'm not careful, Fluffy could really die.

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:42.360
Gadget of Toiletry: Blessed Bathroom Bust of Blowing!

00:14:42.360 --> 00:14:44.190
Where'd you pull <i>that</i> from?

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:46.240
Let me see Fluffy.

00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:46.940
What are you doing?

00:14:46.940 --> 00:14:48.700
I'm going to save her.

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:53.240
Just like the God of Misfortune's syringe, this is a device designed to affect one specific target.

00:14:53.240 --> 00:14:58.210
It transfers some of my Fortune into the recipient as I blow.

00:14:58.210 --> 00:15:00.670
Hm? What did you just say?

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:02.840
Didn't you say you'd never heard of a God of Misfortune before?

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:06.960
What happened?!

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:11.050
I blew too hard and accidentally released more Fortune than necessary!

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:13.220
So what's going to happen?

00:15:13.220 --> 00:15:14.560
She'll become a god.

00:15:14.560 --> 00:15:15.760
What?!

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:26.480
Wh-What did she become?

00:15:26.480 --> 00:15:27.900
A Beckoning Cat.

00:15:27.900 --> 00:15:29.530
She's waving to us.

00:15:29.530 --> 00:15:30.990
Yes, because she's a Beckoning Cat.

00:15:30.990 --> 00:15:35.120
In times of crisis, the Beckoning Cat guides its master to Fortune.

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:37.740
I'm not going to save you.

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:43.040
But if she wishes to save you, I won't interfere.

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:44.920
Fluffy!

00:15:52.470 --> 00:15:53.260
But, Fluffy!

00:15:53.800 --> 00:15:56.430
If we go this way, we won't be able to get down!

00:15:57.510 --> 00:15:59.020
You want me to jump from the window?

00:16:01.440 --> 00:16:03.020
I don't really get it, but...

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:06.610
I believe in you, Fluffy!

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:19.200
Phew, I made it.

00:16:19.870 --> 00:16:22.330
You! What were you doing there?

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:25.130
Did you come here to save me?

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:26.420
No way.

00:16:32.970 --> 00:16:34.510
All right! Come to mama, Fortune!

00:16:35.180 --> 00:16:36.720
To my side, Soumin Shourai!

00:16:41.770 --> 00:16:43.850
Huh? It's not here?

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:45.980
What's the holdup?!

00:16:50.780 --> 00:16:53.530
Geez, where'd you come from?

00:16:57.990 --> 00:16:58.580
The gym's burning!

00:16:59.200 --> 00:17:02.540
First the old class building, and now this? What's <i>with</i> our school?

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:06.040
What the hell?

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:07.670
Water from below ground?

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:08.790
It's hot!

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:10.250
What is this?

00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:11.130
A hot spring?

00:17:16.470 --> 00:17:18.100
Sakura Ichiko.

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:22.770
There's something I want to give you.

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:31.820
Aw, we're in the red again.

00:17:32.530 --> 00:17:33.860
Looks like you're having a hard time.

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:38.070
Your favorite phrase used to be "What a pain,"

00:17:38.070 --> 00:17:40.990
but it looks like you've changed quite a bit since coming to the human world.

00:17:40.990 --> 00:17:42.580
Is that so?

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:46.250
Anyway, did you give her the item?

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:47.460
Yes.

00:17:47.460 --> 00:17:50.920
And you didn't reveal that we know each other, right?

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:53.260
I-It should be fine. Probably.

00:17:53.670 --> 00:18:01.430
This time, our plan was like getting a kid who hates pumpkins to eat them by sneaking them into a stew.

00:18:01.810 --> 00:18:05.140
But if it gets out that I was behind this, it's all over.

00:18:05.140 --> 00:18:06.520
I know.

00:18:06.520 --> 00:18:12.610
Your goal is to teach Sakura Ichiko what is truly important, right?

00:18:18.990 --> 00:18:21.740
<i>There's something I want to give you.</i>

00:18:22.530 --> 00:18:24.410
<i>It's called a Keystone.</i>

00:18:24.830 --> 00:18:32.670
<i>As long as you remain in direct contact with it, it will prevent you from draining Fortune from others.</i>

